          "title": "Funfzehnern",
          "subtitle": "Trick-taking",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Funfzehnern is a simple German no-trump point-trick game for four individual players using a 32-card pack."
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Funfzehnern is a German eight-card point-trick game with a simple card-point schedule and unusual valuation around the four Obers. It is played without trumps by four individual players."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Setup",
          "subtitle": "Table, deck, equipment, and deal",
