              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "4 players use the table arrangement described for Funfzehnern."
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "32-card German or piquet pack"
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "32-card German or piquet pack, score area, and enough table space for play."
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Deal 32-card German or piquet pack for 4 players according to the local rules before the first trick."
